{"seq":1,"slug":"condition-market-residual-value","title":"成色与市场残值估价模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/used-tradein-valuation/condition-market-residual-value","wordCount":2395,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"成色与市场残值估价模型\">成色与市场残值估价模型</h1><p>旧手机的估价现场通常是这样：用户在前端勾选「屏幕无划痕」「电池健康良好」，系统两秒内返回一个数字。这个数字不是查表得来的——同型号同容量的机器在不同成色下能差出三成价差，而「成色」是一个用户自述的主观量。估价模型要做的事，是把这个主观量拆成一组可采集、可核对、可复现的客观特征，再用同型号的二手成交数据把特征映射成价格。拆不干净，模型输出就只是一个装饰性的数字；拆干净了，它才成为后面整条换新链路的定价基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-估价的三个输入层\">核心概念：估价的三个输入层</h2><p>估价的输入端可以严格分成三层，三层的可靠性依次递减，所以模型的设计必须让高可靠层主导、低可靠层只做微调。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[设备身份层&lt;br/&gt;型号/容量/网络制式] --&gt; D[残值基准价 base]&#10;  B[市场层&lt;br/&gt;同型号二手成交曲线] --&gt; D&#10;  C[状态层&lt;br/&gt;成色/功能/电池/配件] --&gt; E[状态扣减因子]&#10;  D --&gt; F[报价区间]&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[报价点值 + 置信度]\">graph TD\n  A[设备身份层&lt;br/&gt;型号/容量/网络制式] --&gt; D[残值基准价 base]\n  B[市场层&lt;br/&gt;同型号二手成交曲线] --&gt; D\n  C[状态层&lt;br/&gt;成色/功能/电池/配件] --&gt; E[状态扣减因子]\n  D --&gt; F[报价区间]\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[报价点值 + 置信度]</pre><p><strong>身份层</strong>是唯一可以做到完全确定的输入。型号、存储容量、蜂窝制式这三项由用户选择或由序列号反查得到，不依赖主观判断。它们的作用是确定「残值基准价」——同型号同容量设备在当前市场的基本盘。身份层的错误不可容忍：把 128GB 认成 256GB，后面的所有计算都无意义。</p>\n<p><strong>市场层</strong>提供时间维度的价格锚。同一个型号的二手成交价随新机发布、季节性促销、汇率波动而变化，基准价必须按周期重新校准，而不是写死在配置里。这一层的数据来源是平台自有的二手成交记录（若有翻新转售业务，见 <a href=\"../circular-downstream-policy/refurb-resell-recycle-route\">翻新转售与回收处置衔接</a>）或外部行情数据。</p>\n<p><strong>状态层</strong>是用户自述的部分，也是误差的主要来源。它的正确用法不是「修正基准价」，而是产生一个乘性扣减因子。把状态层做成加性修正会在低价设备上产生负价格，这是实践中最常见的模型缺陷。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入层</th>\n<th>采集方式</th>\n<th>可靠性</th>\n<th>在模型中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>身份层</td>\n<td>用户选择 / 序列号反查</td>\n<td>高（可核对）</td>\n<td>决定基准价 base</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场层</td>\n<td>成交数据周期回归</td>\n<td>中（有滞后）</td>\n<td>校准 base 的时间漂移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态层</td>\n<td>用户自述 + 到检核对</td>\n<td>低（主观）</td>\n<td>产生乘性扣减因子</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成色到特征的转换\">成色到特征的转换</h2><p>「九成新」这个词在模型里没有位置，因为它不可核对。正确的做法是把它展开成一组二值或枚举特征，每一项都能在验机台上被确认或否认。下面这张表是手机品类的一个可落地切法，它的设计原则是「验机台上能测的才作为特征」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>取值</th>\n<th>采集</th>\n<th>验机台可核对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>屏幕状态</td>\n<td>完好 / 轻微划痕 / 破损</td>\n<td>用户自述</td>\n<td>是（目检 + 触摸）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背板/边框</td>\n<td>完好 / 轻微痕迹 / 变形</td>\n<td>用户自述</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能完好</td>\n<td>全部正常 / 部分异常</td>\n<td>用户自述</td>\n<td>是（功能测试）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电池健康</td>\n<td>区间选择</td>\n<td>系统读取</td>\n<td>是（读电池数据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原装配件</td>\n<td>有无充电器/包装</td>\n<td>用户勾选</td>\n<td>否（不做抵扣）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆修记录</td>\n<td>无 / 有</td>\n<td>用户自述</td>\n<td>部分（螺丝/胶痕）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>电池健康在移动设备上尤其关键，因为它是唯一可以被系统直接读取的状态量。Apple 的电池文档给出的口径很明确：锂离子电池「设计为在经过大量充电循环后仍保留原始容量的 80%」，而一次完整循环是累计放电达到 100% 容量，而非一次放电（<a href=\"https://www.apple.com/batteries/why-lithium-ion/\">Apple: Why Lithium-ion</a>）。这意味着电池健康度的采集可以做成分档而不是连续值——80% 这条线是厂商自己定义的可用性边界，直接把它当作扣减的跳变点，比拟合一条连续曲线更稳。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"FEATURE_WEIGHTS = {&#10;    &quot;screen&quot;:   {&quot;intact&quot;: 0.00, &quot;scratch&quot;: 0.06, &quot;cracked&quot;: 0.28},&#10;    &quot;body&quot;:     {&quot;intact&quot;: 0.00, &quot;worn&quot;: 0.03, &quot;deformed&quot;: 0.10},&#10;    &quot;function&quot;: {&quot;ok&quot;: 0.00, &quot;partial&quot;: 0.35},&#10;    &quot;battery&quot;:  {&quot;ge90&quot;: 0.00, &quot;ge80&quot;: 0.04, &quot;lt80&quot;: 0.15},&#10;    &quot;repaired&quot;: {&quot;no&quot;: 0.00, &quot;yes&quot;: 0.12},&#10;}&#10;&#10;def condition_factor(features):&#10;    total = 0.0&#10;    for key, mapping in FEATURE_WEIGHTS.items():&#10;        total += mapping[features[key]]&#10;    return max(1.0 - total, 0.0)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">FEATURE_WEIGHTS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"screen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:   {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"intact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scratch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.06</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cracked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:     {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"intact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"worn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.03</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deformed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"partial\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.35</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"battery\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:  {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ge90\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ge80\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.04</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lt80\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"repaired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> condition_factor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(features):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key, mapping </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> FEATURE_WEIGHTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mapping[features[key]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个结构的两个性质值得注意。第一，扣减是<strong>乘性</strong>的：<code>price = base * condition_factor</code>，所以低价设备不会算出负数。第二，因子是<strong>可累加后再截断</strong>的：单项权重之和可能超过 1，<code>max(..., 0.0)</code> 保证因子非负，而各单项权重本身由回归拟合得到，不是拍脑袋。</p>\n<h3 id=\"扣减权重怎么拟合\">扣减权重怎么拟合</h3><p>权重不该由人工设定，而应由历史「自述特征 → 实检结果 → 最终成交价」的三段数据回归得到。可行的做法是用一个线性模型拟合 <code>log(实检价 / 基准价)</code>，其特征就是上面的枚举值做 one-hot。用对数价格的理由是残值率在低价段和高价段都近似服从相对变化而非绝对变化。</p>\n<p>拟合时有一个陷阱：训练样本只包含<strong>完成到检</strong>的交易，而放弃换新的样本缺失。这意味着样本对「用户高估成色」的情形有偏——高估的用户更容易在看到实检价后放弃，从而退出样本。修正的办法是给训练样本按到检前流失概率加权，或引入一个独立的样本外校准集。这个偏差无法靠调模型解决，只能靠采样策略解决，它也是下一篇 <a href=\"quote-confidence-adjust\">估价置信度与到检调整</a> 讨论区间宽度的直接动机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"市场残值的基准价校准\">市场残值的基准价校准</h2><p>基准价不是常数，而是一条随型号生命周期衰减的曲线。三种校准方式各有适用场景。</p>\n<p>第一种是<strong>成交中位数法</strong>：取同型号同容量近 N 天成交价的加权中位数作为基准。优点是稳健、不受极端价影响，缺点是需要足够成交量，冷门型号不适用。第二种是<strong>衰减曲线法</strong>：对热门型号拟合「上市月数 → 残值率」的衰减函数（常见形态是前 12 个月快速衰减、之后趋缓），用函数外推冷门型号。第三种是<strong>锚定型法</strong>：选一个成交充分的参照型号，用两者的新机价之比换算。三者可以级联——有成交量走第一种，没有走第二种，样本过少走第三种。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 基准价校准：近 30 天同型号同容量成交的加权中位数&#10;WITH recent AS (&#10;  SELECT price_cents,&#10;         EXP(-0.05 * EXTRACT(DAY FROM (CURRENT_DATE - sold_at))) AS w&#10;  FROM tradein_completed_deals&#10;  WHERE model_id = :model_id&#10;    AND capacity_gb = :capacity_gb&#10;    AND sold_at &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;30 days&#39;&#10;    AND price_cents IS NOT NULL&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  PERCENTILE_CONT(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY price_cents)&#10;    AS base_price_cents&#10;FROM recent;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 基准价校准：近 30 天同型号同容量成交的加权中位数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_cents,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         EXP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">05</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DAY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sold_at))) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tradein_completed_deals</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :model_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> capacity_gb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :capacity_gb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sold_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_cents </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  PERCENTILE_CONT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_cents)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_price_cents</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recent;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>校准的周期必须是显式的配置项而不是硬编码。新机发布窗口（通常是每年秋季）会让上一代型号的基准价在两周内跳降，如果校准周期是一个季度，这段窗口内所有报价都会系统性偏高。</p>\n<h3 id=\"汇率与跨境价差\">汇率与跨境价差</h3><p>跨境换新的基准价还要处理汇率和地区价差两个额外维度。同一个型号在德国和美国的二手成交价不同，而报价货币可能既不是成交货币也不是结算货币。稳妥的做法是：基准价按「成交地货币」维护，报价时用<strong>带保护带</strong>的汇率换算——即用一个不会立刻随市场波动更新的内部汇率，同时给报价设置一个偏离上限，避免在汇率剧烈波动时产生套利。汇率的结算细节属于另一条链路，本篇只把「报价货币 ≠ 成交货币」这个事实写进模型输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从基准价到报价点值\">从基准价到报价点值</h2><p>把三层拼起来，最终的报价点值是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>quote</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>base</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>model</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>capacity</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>condition</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>market-adjust</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{quote}} = \\text{base}(\\text{model}, \\text{capacity}, t) \\times f_{\\text{condition}}(\\vec{x}) \\times f_{\\text{market-adjust}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quote</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">model</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">capacity</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">condition</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2077em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">market-adjust</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>market-adjust</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{market-adjust}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">market-adjust</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一个小幅修正项，用来吸收地区价差与短期供需（例如某型号翻新需求突然上升）。这一项的经验范围很窄，通常控制在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>±</mo><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pm 8\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">±</span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span></span></span></span></span> 以内，超出这个范围说明基准价本身该重新校准而不是靠修正项打补丁。</p>\n<p>模型输出的落库结构必须同时保留点值和中间量，否则后续的到检对账无法解释差额的来源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;quote_id&quot;: &quot;q_8f21c&quot;,&#10;  &quot;model_id&quot;: &quot;iphone-14-pro&quot;,&#10;  &quot;capacity_gb&quot;: 256,&#10;  &quot;base_price_cents&quot;: 41200,&#10;  &quot;condition_factor&quot;: 0.82,&#10;  &quot;market_adjust&quot;: 0.98,&#10;  &quot;quote_price_cents&quot;: 33106,&#10;  &quot;feature_snapshot&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;screen&quot;: &quot;scratch&quot;,&#10;    &quot;body&quot;: &quot;intact&quot;,&#10;    &quot;function&quot;: &quot;ok&quot;,&#10;    &quot;battery&quot;: &quot;ge80&quot;,&#10;    &quot;repaired&quot;: &quot;no&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;base_calibrated_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-20T00:00:00Z&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quote_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"q_8f21c\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"model_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iphone-14-pro\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"capacity_gb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"base_price_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">41200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"condition_factor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.82</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market_adjust\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.98</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"quote_price_cents\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">33106</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"feature_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"screen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scratch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"body\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"intact\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ok\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"battery\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ge80\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"repaired\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"base_calibrated_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-20T00:00:00Z\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>feature_snapshot</code> 是不可省的：它是报价时用户自述的冻结副本，到检验机拿它和实检结果逐项比对，差额才能归因到具体特征。没有这个快照，第三章的差异结算就只剩一个无法辩护的金额。同时 <code>base_calibrated_at</code> 让「报价为什么是那个数」在事后可复现——基准价的校准版本必须与报价一起留存。</p>\n<h3 id=\"定价一致性检查\">定价一致性检查</h3><p>模型上线后需要一组一致性检查作为回归防线：同一型号的报价必须随容量单调不减；成色扣减后价格不得高于无扣减价格；跨地区的同型号报价换算后偏离不得超过保护带。这些检查不涉及模型精度，只涉及逻辑自洽，可以放在报价服务的出口做断言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>估价拆成身份层、市场层、状态层三层，可靠性依次递减，高可靠层决定基准价、低可靠层只做乘性扣减。</li>\n<li>「九成新」必须展开成验机台可核对的枚举特征；电池健康是移动设备上唯一可直接读取的状态量，以 80% 保留容量为跳变点。</li>\n<li>扣减权重用 <code>log(实检价/基准价)</code> 线性回归拟合，并注意「放弃换新样本缺失」带来的选择偏差。</li>\n<li>基准价是随型号生命周期衰减的曲线，校准周期必须显式配置，避开新机发布窗口。</li>\n<li>报价落库必须保留 feature_snapshot 与校准时间戳，否则到检差额无法归因。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成色与市场残值估价模型","id":"成色与市场残值估价模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：估价的三个输入层","id":"核心概念-估价的三个输入层"},{"level":2,"text":"成色到特征的转换","id":"成色到特征的转换"},{"level":3,"text":"扣减权重怎么拟合","id":"扣减权重怎么拟合"},{"level":2,"text":"市场残值的基准价校准","id":"市场残值的基准价校准"},{"level":3,"text":"汇率与跨境价差","id":"汇率与跨境价差"},{"level":2,"text":"从基准价到报价点值","id":"从基准价到报价点值"},{"level":3,"text":"定价一致性检查","id":"定价一致性检查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"估价置信度与到检调整","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-in-exchange-program/used-tradein-valuation/quote-confidence-adjust"}}